     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div vlink=\"purple\" link=\"blue\" lang=\"EN-GB\">\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Verdana;color:#000000;font-size:10pt\">\r\n<font size=\"2\">Dear all,<br>\r\n<br>\r\nthree postdoc positions that may be interesting to readers of this list.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nBest regards  ---- Marc<br>\r\n</font>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Times New Roman;color:#000000;font-size:16px\">\r\n<hr>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"Tahoma\" color=\"#000000\"><b>From:</b> Tord Snäll [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Tord....@slu.se</a>]<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> 24 May 2017 16:06<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> Tord Snäll<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> postdocs on metapopulation and forest modelling<br>\r\n</font><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Dear all,</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">I would appreciate help to spread these announcement of three postdoc positions.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Two postdocs/researchers: Modelling for viability analyses of populations and communities in forest</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"http://epi-resurs.slu.se/Platsannonser/pdf.cfm?Platsannonser_id=5250&amp;sprak=e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://epi-resurs.slu.se/Platsannonser/pdf.cfm?Platsannonser_id%3D5250%26sprak%3De&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494831815000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3I49ivaPaf2Ih-DURyGE2n\">http://epi-resurs.slu.se/Platsannonser/pdf.cfm?Platsannonser_id=5250&amp;sprak=e</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"SV\"> </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Postdoc/researcher: Simulation of future forestry and conservation strategies</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a href=\"http://epi-resurs.slu.se/Platsannonser/pdf.cfm?Platsannonser_id=5251&amp;sprak=e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://epi-resurs.slu.se/Platsannonser/pdf.cfm?Platsannonser_id%3D5251%26sprak%3De&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792494831815000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1YOoCrubnzAKxkJNQw4S4B\">http://epi-resurs.slu.se/Platsannonser/pdf.cfm?Platsannonser_id=5251&amp;sprak=e</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Sorry for cross-posting.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Best regards,</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"SV\">Tord</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"> </p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:black\">--<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\">Tord Snäll<br>\r\nProfessor</span><span style=\"color:black\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\"> </span><span style=\"color:black\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\">Sveriges lantbruksuniversitet<br>\r\nSwedish University of Agricultural Sciences</span></b><span style=\"color:black\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\"> </span><span style=\"color:black\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"SV\">ArtDatabanken/Swedish Species Information Centre</span><span style=\"color:black\" lang=\"SV\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"SV\">Box 7007, SE-750 07 Uppsala</span><span style=\"color:black\" lang=\"SV\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\" lang=\"SV\">Besöksadress: Almas allé 8E\r\n</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNor